{"bangumi":{"date":"2007-09-13","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/ec/1f/2733_ZtxYP.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/ec/1f/2733_ZtxYP.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/ec/1f/2733_ZtxYP.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/ec/1f/2733_ZtxYP.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/ec/1f/2733_ZtxYP.jpg"},"summary":"太田垣康男による近未来の宇宙開発時代を描いたSFヒューマンドラマをアニメ化。本作は第1シーズンからおよそ3ヵ月の休止期間を挟んで放送された。猿渡吾郎とロストマン、登山のパートナー同士であった二人は別々の道を歩み、それぞれの形で宇宙を目指す。アメリカ宇宙軍で力を付けていくロストマンだが、部下の機体が消息を絶ってしまう。一方、吾郎のいるISS（国際宇宙ステーション）でも事故が発生。宇宙という雄大な世界に男たちが挑む……。第2シーズンも前作の監督・鈴木行ら同様の制作陣が集結。アニメの制作を『ミルモでぽん！』などで知られるスタジオ雲雀が務めた。","name":"Moonlight Mile -Touch down-","name_cn":"月光旅程 -Touch down-","tags":[{"name":"科幻","count":76,"total_count":249290},{"name":"TV","count":64,"total_count":1388771},{"name":"2007","count":50,"total_count":37335},{"name":"硬科幻","count":49,"total_count":636},{"name":"月光旅程","count":34,"total_count":80},{"name":"漫画改","count":33,"total_count":848996},{"name":"StudioHibari","count":25,"total_count":149},{"name":"男人的童话","count":15,"total_count":16},{"name":"漫改","count":13,"total_count":357704},{"name":"2007年9月","count":13,"total_count":169},{"name":"SF","count":11,"total_count":7142},{"name":"太田垣康男","count":11,"total_count":30},{"name":"スタジオ雲雀","count":10,"total_count":470},{"name":"日本","count":6,"total_count":287853},{"name":"铃木行","count":4,"total_count":28},{"name":"季番","count":3,"total_count":8375},{"name":"鈴木行","count":3,"total_count":70},{"name":"moonlight","count":3,"total_count":5},{"name":"00年代","count":2,"total_count":1239},{"name":"7分","count":2,"total_count":3795},{"name":"日本动画","count":2,"total_count":34702},{"name":"遠藤明範","count":2,"total_count":78},{"name":"mile","count":2,"total_count":3},{"name":"TVA","count":2,"total_count":15389},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35383},{"name":"后宫","count":2,"total_count":298715},{"name":"军事","count":1,"total_count":2212},{"name":"云雀工作室","count":